{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54668","headline":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 六 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日光晕，有晕要须知。\n阙处预先防（京本作「堤」）备吉，忽然不阙亦（京本作「不」）须疑，三日雨淋漓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54668.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54668","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}